# Settings that locate the receiver, read by adsb-approach.service at start (README: "Location settings from the
# environment"). deploy/install.sh writes this file once and keeps it afterwards. These are examples: uncommenting
# a line overrides the value in the configuration file; left commented, as shipped, it changes nothing.
# ADSB_APPROACH_SOURCE_HOST=127.0.0.1
# ADSB_APPROACH_SOURCE_PORT=30047
# ADSB_APPROACH_TAR1090_URL=http://127.0.0.1/tar1090/
